Z||000011||Jimmy||10-09-2001||12:16 AM||||I went to Rock Falls Raceway in sconnie.  I am probably going back this weekend.  Gonna try a holley carb and possibly some slicks.  I know my clutch won't be any better but I want t o drag again!  I'm gonna see what I can do for 60' times, 1/8th mile, and R/T. <P>After next weekend its time to build the motor up.  Should have over 400 horses and 430 or so Ftlbs of torque.  Best part is its only gonna cost me about $1000 to do that.  Starting to find out why they say "Nothing beats a Small Block when it comes to dollars per HP."  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>BTW, next weekend is import day saturday and fun run sunday.  LMK if anyone wants to go.<P>Jim<BR>||||reg||1
